*.pyc

# Data — never commit Lending Club files (size + redistribution terms)
data/raw/*
data/interim/*
data/processed/*
!data/**/.gitkeep
!data/**/README.md

# Outputs
outputs/models/*.joblib
# Figures ARE tracked: README.md embeds them, and GitHub renders the README as
